                                "sense_id": "a5a531a1-351f-3eb9-9108-fc1381c367d0",
                                "text": "Upon his return from Africa, he was honoured with the triumphal ornaments, and admitted among the Titian prieſts, and the prieſts of Auguſtus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a72ffde-a9a8-3966-bd3a-054f667d1780",
                        "entry_id": "3e6690f3-f0fe-320c-8ebd-488efd0c1c92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to the Roman emperor Titus (r. 79–81 AD)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "189e76fd-6c5d-47ca-8c34-b90e2239aed7",
                                "sense_id": "7a72ffde-a9a8-3966-bd3a-054f667d1780",
                                "text": "On the Titian arch it is sculptured, but remains now in only a mutilated state; […]"
